msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The sight of their abundantly blooming roses—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫a veritable symbol of prosperity—⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫long since withered and turned into soil."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A visão das abundantes rosas florescendo—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫um verdadeiro símbolo de prosperidade—"
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫há muito tempo, murchado e virado terra. "

